Licensing overview
==================

This repository follows the REUSE specification (https://reuse.software).
The authoritative per-file licensing is in REUSE.toml; full license texts
are in LICENSES/.

Talk content - CC-BY-4.0
  data/**, *.index.html
  Copyright 2026 krahlos
  Slides, speaker notes and research notes. You may share and adapt them,
  also commercially, as long as you give credit ("krahlos, CC BY 4.0")
  and indicate changes. See LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Code, configuration and docs - EUPL-1.2
  everything else, unless listed below
  Copyright 2026 krahlos
  European Union Public Licence v1.2. See LICENSES/EUPL-1.2.txt.

Third-party components
