                             Jeffrey, 2004 John Gruber
  src/vendor/qrcode-generator.js  QR Code Generator - MIT
                             Copyright 2009 Kazuhiko Arase
  src/vendor/smol-toml.cjs   smol-toml - BSD-3-Clause
                             Copyright Squirrel Chat et al.
  src/fonts/*                Atkinson Hyperlegible - OFL-1.1
                             Copyright 2020 Braille Institute of America, Inc.

  src/img/github-invertocat-black.svg  GitHub Invertocat - trademark of GitHub, Inc.,
                             not open-licensed; see LICENSES/LicenseRef-GitHub-Logo-Policy.txt

Logos and images of third parties keep their own terms; each one is listed
in REUSE.toml with its source.
